  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "淨零碳排分析與評估",
    "sub_ename": "NET ZERO CARBON EMISSION ANALYSIS AND ASSESSMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程除整體介紹淨零碳排相關議題與案例外，並教授學員如何運用生態系統服務評估（Integrated Valuation of Ecosystem Services and Tradeoffs, InVEST）模式進行減碳相關課題的評估與分析。課程涵蓋碳匯、碳儲存、沿海藍碳、水源涵養、都市降溫、生態棲地品質以及未來情境分析等主題。在課程中，學員將學習如何評估生態系統中的碳匯潛力，並瞭解碳儲存的重要性及評估方法。同時，探討沿海藍碳的價值與保護方法，並學習水源涵養的評估與管理策略。此外，課程還將介紹都市降溫的生態服務價值和評估指標，以及生態棲地品質的評估方法和保護措施。最後，學員將使用InVEST工具進行未來情境分析，以評估不同情境下的減碳策略效果和影響。透過這些學習，學員將能夠深入瞭解並應用InVEST工具，以評估減碳相關的生態系統服務。這將有助於提升他們在減碳領域中的專業知識和技能，並為未來的永續發展做出貢獻。",
    "describe_eh": "The issues and cases of net zero emission will be holistically introduced, this course is also designed to teach participants how to use the InVEST (Integrated Valuation of Ecosystem Services and Tradeoffs) model for assessing and analyzing carbon-related issues. The course covers topics such as carbon sequestration, carbon storage, coastal blue carbon, water yield, urban cooling, ecological habitat quality, and future scenario analysis. During the course, participants will learn how to assess the carbon sequestration potential in ecosystems and understand the importance of carbon storage and assessment methods. They will also explore the value and conservation methods of coastal blue carbon and learn about the assessment and management strategies for water yield. Additionally, the course will introduce the ecological service value and assessment indicators for urban cooling, as well as the assessment methods and conservation measures for ecological habitat quality. Finally, participants will use the InVEST tool for future scenario analysis to evaluate the effectiveness and impacts of carbon reduction strategies under different scenarios. Through this learning experience, participants will gain a deep understanding of and practical skills in using the InVEST tool to assess carbon-related ecosystem services. This will contribute to their professional knowledge and skills in the field of carbon reduction and make a positive impact on future sustainable development.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "介紹碳匯和碳儲存的概念，包括綠碳、藍碳、黃碳的定義與重要性",
      "describe_en": "Introduce the concepts of carbon sequestration and carbon storage, including definitions and importance of green carbon, blue carbon, and yellow carbon."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "透過InVEST工具建立模型，分析不同策略對碳匯和儲存的影響",
      "describe_en": "Analyze the impact of different strategies on carbon sequestration and storage through the use of the InVEST tool."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "減少對都市開發對生態系統造成壓力與減少碳排放",
      "describe_en": "Reduce the pressure on ecosystems caused by urban development and decrease carbon emissions."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "根據模型結果，討論如何制定和實施有效的減碳政策",
      "describe_en": "Based on the model results, discuss how to develop and implement effective carbon reduction policies."
    }
  ],
